OL,3,APM warned Rosebank oil field could
OL,4,Abreach West Bank sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has been warned that
OL,7,Fapproving a controversial oil field
OL,8,Frisks contravening his own sanctions on
OL,9,Fillegal Israeli settlements in the West
OL,10,FBank.
OL,12,FThe government will soon have to make a
OL,13,Flong-awaited decision on whether to go
OL,14,Fahead with Rosebank, Britain's largest
OL,15,Funtapped oil field, which sits off
OL,16,FShetland.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
